<article>
    <section>
        <h2>1. Kairaba Beach Hotel</h2>
        <p>
            Nestled along the serene coast of Kololi, Kairaba Beach Hotel is renowned for its luxury and outstanding service. With spacious
            rooms, a beautiful garden, and a large pool, it offers a tranquil retreat for all guests. Its fine dining restaurants and
            beachfront location make it a favorite for visitors seeking relaxation and comfort.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section>
        <h2>2. Coco Ocean Resort & Spa</h2>
        <p>
            This upscale resort is known for its stunning architecture and luxurious spa services. Located in Bijilo, Coco Ocean Resort &
            Spa provides private beach access, exquisite dining options, and an array of spa treatments, making it a perfect choice for
            those looking to indulge in a pampered vacation.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section>
        <h2>3. Sunprime Tamala Beach Resort</h2>
        <p>
            Offering modern rooms and suites, Sunprime Tamala Beach Resort is an adults-only paradise located directly on the beach. With an
            infinity pool, beachfront bars, and nightly entertainment, this resort is ideal for couples and groups looking for a lively yet
            relaxing holiday experience.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section>
        <h2>4. Kombo Beach Hotel</h2>
        <p>
            Located in Kotu, Kombo Beach Hotel is famous for its vibrant atmosphere and family-friendly amenities. With multiple
            restaurants, a large pool, and a variety of activities including water sports, it caters to travelers of all ages. The hotel
            also offers easy access to local attractions and markets.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section>
        <h2>5. Labranda Coral Beach Resort</h2>
        <p>
            Positioned on the Brufut Heights, Labranda Coral Beach Resort boasts stunning views of the Atlantic Ocean. This all-inclusive
            resort offers spacious rooms, a wellness spa, and numerous dining options, ensuring a comfortable and relaxing stay for guests
            seeking both adventure and tranquility.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section>
        <h2>6. African Princess Beach Hotel</h2>
        <p>
            Featuring modern rooms with direct pool access, the African Princess Beach Hotel in Kotu is perfect for those who love a blend
            of comfort and style. The hotel provides excellent beach access, a variety of dining options, and a laid-back ambiance, ideal
            for a romantic getaway or a relaxing family vacation.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section>
        <h2>7. Ocean Bay Hotel & Resort</h2>
        <p>
            Located in Cape Point, Ocean Bay Hotel & Resort offers a perfect blend of traditional Gambian hospitality and modern luxury.
            Guests can enjoy a variety of facilities including a large pool, spa services, and restaurants offering local and international
            cuisine. Its beachfront location makes it popular among both leisure and business travelers.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section>
        <h2>8. Balafon Beach Resort</h2>
        <p>
            Exclusively for adults, Balafon Beach Resort in Kololi provides an intimate and tranquil experience. The resort's
            African-inspired architecture, serene pool areas, and private beach access create a peaceful environment for relaxation and
            romance, making it a top choice for honeymooners.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section>
        <h2>9. Senegambia Beach Hotel</h2>
        <p>
            One of the most popular hotels in Gambia, Senegambia Beach Hotel is set amidst lush tropical gardens along the Kololi beach.
            Known for its lively atmosphere, guests can enjoy a range of activities including bird watching, cultural performances, and
            water sports, making it perfect for families and solo travelers alike.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section>
        <h2>10. Ngala Lodge</h2>
        <p>
            This boutique hotel offers a unique blend of luxury and intimacy. Perched on a cliff in Fajara, Ngala Lodge provides stunning
            ocean views, individually designed suites, and gourmet dining experiences. It's an ideal spot for couples and those seeking a
            secluded, upscale retreat away from the hustle and bustle.
        </p>
    </section>
</article>
